# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the C ABI's TSan run (tools/abi_tsan.py).
# Like lsan.supp, only frames inside system libraries may be listed; a race
# in GUI.Forms code is a defect to fix, never a suppression. Each entry names
# the host and the report it answers.
#
# Format: one `race:`, `mutex:`, `thread:`, `signal:` or
# `called_from_lib:` rule per line (see the ThreadSanitizer documentation).
